# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0163.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
kubectl apply -> API Server
API Server -> Admission Webhook
Admission Webhook -> Gatekeeper Controller
Gatekeeper Controller -> OPA Engine
Constraint Templates -> OPA Engine
Constraints -> OPA Engine
OPA Engine -> Admission Webhook: Allow/Deny
Admission Webhook -> API Server: Allow/Deny

User Request { kubectl apply }
API Server { API Server, Admission Webhook }
Gatekeeper { Gatekeeper Controller, Constraint Templates, Constraints, OPA Engine }
